//      FACTORY_TEST_SLOT_STARTED_FILE (the epoch seconds are written here just before the command starts),
//      FACTORY_TEST_SLOT_TRACK_FILE (processes that left the command's group are remembered here from one call to the next),
//      FACTORY_TEST_SLOT_WAIT_DIR (a folder of the step: each wait for a slot is recorded there as <startMs>-<pid>.wait, touched
//        at least every 5 s while it lasts and renamed to .done when it ends, so the step's time limit can leave the wait out;
//        a folder that cannot be written changes nothing),
