// path; anything else is ignored) and FACTORY_WORKSPACE_TEST_SLOTS (1 or more) limit the test runs of one workspace: the
// command first takes a slot in <slots-dir>/workspaces/<id>/slot-N, then a machine slot, always in that order. The machine
// total still applies. A workspace limit is never skipped: when no workspace slot comes free in time, or its folder cannot be
